<title>USA: Aura Systems files extension for Form 10K.</title>
<headline>Aura Systems files extension for Form 10K.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aura Systems Inc, a maker of high-technology electronic products, on Friday said it has filed for a 15-day extension to file its Form 10K with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it is being delayed by including foreign subsidiaries for the first time.</p>
</text>
